==Dutch==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ʋar/}} (NL) /war/ (B, Sur).

===Adverb===
'''waar'''

# {{interrogative}} [[where]]
#: ''Waar is Jan?''' - Where is John?
# {{interrogative}} locative adverbial part of a separable [[pronominal adverb]], replacing [[what]]
#: [[waarvoor]]: '''''Waar''' is dat goed '''voor?''''' - What is that good for?
# {{relative}} [[where]]
#: ''dit is waar hij woont'' - This is where he lives
# {{relative}} locative adverbial part of a separable pronominal adverb, replacing [[what]]
#: e.g. [[waarvoor]]: ''Dit is '''waar'''  dat goed '''voor''' is'' - This is what that is good for.

